{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-q-beta-c-k-leading-bias-correction-identity","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:q-beta-c-k-leading-bias-correction-identity","kind":"proposition","title":"Leading-bias correction identity for joint-fit extraction of the $c_k$ ladder — $\\hat c_k - \\hat c_{k+1} \\cdot u_0 = c_k^{\\mathrm{alg}}$ when the extraction bias is $\\hat c_k = c_k^{\\mathrm{alg}} + c_{k+1}^{\\mathrm{alg}} \\cdot u_0$ (one-line ring)","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-q-beta-c-2-eq-neg-one-structural","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-q-beta-c-k-recursion-from-habiro-q-difference"],"cites":["references/jones1987"],"tags":["q-beta","precision-ladder","structural","c-k","generating-function","bias-correction","categorical-derivation"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.QBeta.CkLeadingBiasCorrection.bias_correction_recovers_alg","text":"q-beta-c-k-leading-bias-correction-identity.md","leanSource":"q-beta-c-k-leading-bias-correction-identity.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:q-beta-c-k-leading-bias-correction-identity\"></a><p><em>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\hat c_k</code> be the joint-fit extraction at <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">u_0 = b(q_0) \\cdot \\hbar_{q_0}^2</code>. Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">c_k^{\\mathrm{alg}}</code> be the algebraic coefficients. If the extraction bias is leading-order linear in <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">u_0</code>, the bias-corrected values <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\hat c_k^{\\mathrm{corr}} := \\hat c_k - \\hat c_{k+1} \\cdot u_0</code> satisfy <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\hat c_k^{\\mathrm{corr}} = c_k^{\\mathrm{alg}} + O(u_0^2)</code>.</em></p>\n<p>Its application to the coefficients extracted from data is recorded in <a href=\"#rem:q-beta-c-k-leading-bias-correction-identity-extraction-check\" data-at=\"mass-theory/mass-algebraic-qbeta-formalize-first-gates\">the extraction check</a>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/q-beta-c-k-leading-bias-correction-identity.md","heading":"Proposition","number":"13.9.21","page":"b/prop-q-beta-c-k-leading-bias-correction-identity","qa":{"counts":{"pass":86,"fail":1,"warn":2,"na":12,"unknown":0,"stale":75},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.Nuclear.QBeta.CkLeadingBiasCorrection.bias_correction_recovers_alg","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/q-beta-c-k-leading-bias-correction-identity.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
